<title>USA: N.M. $64.8 mln GOs won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>N.M. $64.8 mln GOs won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it won $64.8 million New Mexico general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 4.599 percent.</p>
